# 2014-5: Mirror Mirror
# A palindrome is a word or phrase whose letters read the same forwards and backwards. Write code which returns a 1 if its character array argument is a palindrome, 0 otherwise. For simplicity"s sake, you may assume that the array is all one case.

Solution ← ≍⊸⇌▽⊸(⌵±)

⍤⤙≍ 1 Solution "a man, a plan, a canal, panama!"
⍤⤙≍ 1 Solution ""
⍤⤙≍ 1 Solution "a"
⍤⤙≍ 0 Solution "APL"
